Let $x_i(t)$ be the number of times switch $i$ has been flipped after $t$ minutes.
The state of switch $i$ after $t$ minutes is $v_i(t) = x_i(t) \pmod 2$.
The total number of minutes $t$ is the sum of the flips for all switches:
$$t = \sum_{i=1}^6 x_i(t)$$
